# BacktobasicsPython — Contexte Agent

## Projet
Background removal as a service : upload image → Celery worker → PyTorch (DeepLabV3) → RGBA PNG sans fond.
**Objectif dual : apprendre ET construire un MVP présentable.**
Source de vérité complète : `PROJECT_CONTEXT.md` à la racine.

## Stack
FastAPI + Uvicorn | PyTorch DeepLabV3 (CPU) | Celery + Redis | Docker Compose | Poetry | Pytest | Locust

## Architecture hexagonale
```
project/src/
├── main.py                            # Entrypoint
├── app/services/                      # file_service.py, image_service.py
├── domain/                            # interfaces.py (ABCs), models.py (dataclasses)
├── infrastructure/
│   ├── api/endpoints.py               # POST /images/upload, POST+GET /images/process
│   ├── celery/tasks.py                # process_image_task (charge ML dans le worker)
│   └── processors.py                  # PyTorchBackgroundRemover
└── utils/decorators.py                # @time_logger
```

## Flux principal
`POST /images/process` → `process_image_task.delay()` → `{ task_id, status: PENDING }`
`GET /images/process/{task_id}` → polling AsyncResult → `{ filename, path, ... }` si SUCCESS

## État actuel (Semaine 5)
- ✅ Semaines 1-4 complètes : archi, ML pipeline, Celery+Docker, decorators, Locust
- ⚠️ `test_image_process_mocked` cassé (attend réponse sync, l'API retourne task_id)
